# SilentMeet: Real-Time Two-User WebRTC Video Call Implementation & Walkthrough

We have extended **SilentMeet** with a production-grade, two-user WebRTC video and audio call system while keeping all existing UI aesthetics, live silent feeds, and MediaPipe AI gesture detection fully intact.

---

## 🚀 Active Services

| Service | Port / URL | Network Accessible | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| **FastAPI Backend & WebRTC Signaling** | `http://127.0.0.1:8000` | `http://0.0.0.0:8000` | 🟢 **RUNNING** (`server.py`) |
| **SilentMeet Frontend** | `http://localhost:5173/` | `http://<LAN_IP>:5173/` | 🟢 **RUNNING** (`npm run dev`) |

